    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-intro">Last updated: June 21, 2026</p>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>At the Centro Artístico Pedagógico Integral (CAPI), we collect personal information that you voluntarily provide when filling out our contact form. This includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Message or inquiry</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Use of information</h2>
      <p>We use your data exclusively to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your questions about our programs.</li>
        <li>Provide information about workshops, events, and activities.</li>
        <li>Process donations (through our secure Donorbox platform).</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties</strong> for commercial purposes.</p>

      <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We use external services that help us operate our site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Netlify:</strong> For web hosting and secure form submissions.</li>
        <li><strong>Namecheap Private Email:</strong> To manage our corporate email.</li>
        <li><strong>Donorbox:</strong> To process donations securely and encrypted.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data at any time. To do so, simply write to <a href="mailto:info@capisamaipata.org">info@capisamaipata.org</a>.</p>
    </div>
